    "updated_at": "2018-08-13T19:02:17Z",
    "body": "It's not clear what it means for any stylistic property to be \"inconsistent with the semantics\". Semantics and styling are separate domains, and don't affect each other in the manner you seem to be describing. The separation of semantics and styling is a core principle of HTML, in fact.",
