    "created_at": "2018-08-13T19:05:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-13T19:05:42Z",
    "body": "In short, I don't quite get why `unicode-bidi: isolate;` is the spec's UA stylesheet recommendation for an `<div>`.\r\n\r\nif we just want to make `div` convey no semantic meaning at all, then what's the intention in the first place for the spec to recommend UA to default to `unicode-bidi: isolate;` for `div`?",
