    "created_at": "2018-08-13T20:20:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-13T20:21:46Z",
    "body": "Yes, article, blockquote etc. also are applied in this issue, but article, blockquote have their intrinsic semantics of being independent bidi. For example, how can an article conceptally be a dependent bidi-content, just no such concept, just an incomplete sentence can be. All articles are \"born\" independent bidi content, so threre's no need to specially mention it for those elements in the spec, that was why I filed this issue only for div.",
