    "body": "So, since div is the \"block\" meaningless element, I think it is still not wrong for the spec to at least mention someting like they are \"block\" meaningless, isn't it?\r\n\r\nSo, if the spec claimed that, code like:\r\n\r\n`I went to the <div>movie, but he</div> didn't.`\r\n\r\nwouldn't be correct usage, even if the `div` is used unsemantically and is purely for styling. At least it should have been `<span>`.",
